            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\n\nI can reproduce with reproduction steps. Session file is indeed written, but it is not detected. I'll take a look.\n\nImportant notes:\n- Do not use `/` inside session name. It is used as file name while `/` is used as path separator and denotes paths with directories.\n- There is no `MiniSessions.pick()`. It was probably meant to be `select()`.",
