        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> Perhaps doing two globs, one for `*` and one for `.*`? This seems to fix the issue.\n\nIt would probably make sense to use `vim.fs.dir()`. This part of code was written way before `vim.fs` existed, so it would be a good change nevertheless.\n\n> I can submit a PR tomorrow if you'd like after adding an appropriate test case.\n\nYep, sounds good. Use `vim.fs.dir()` in a loop, please.",
